# Project Overview

## Introduction
Presa is a web-based presentation creation tool, similar to gamma.app. It allows users to create slides with AI assistance, edit them manually, and export them in various formats.

## Project Structure
- [src/app](mdc:src/app): Next.js app directory with routing configuration
- [src/components](mdc:src/components): Reusable UI components
- [src/elements](mdc:src/elements): Basic building blocks for slides
- [src/store](mdc:src/store): State management using Zustand
- [src/types](mdc:src/types): TypeScript type definitions
- [src/utils](mdc:src/utils): Helper functions and utilities
- [src/contexts](mdc:src/contexts): React context providers

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js with React 19
- Styling: TailwindCSS and CSS Modules
- State Management: Zustand
- Rich Text Editing: TipTap
- Authentication: NextAuth
- Database: MongoDB with Prisma